    "• Cancel: Keep the original location unchanged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 取消操作：保持原位置不变"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 取消操作：保持原位置不變"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 取消操作：保持原位置不變"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Cancel: Keep the original location unchanged"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Do not close the app during migration. Cancelling may leave data incomplete": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 迁移过程中请勿关闭应用，取消迁移可能导致数据不完整"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 遷移過程中請勿關閉應用，取消遷移可能導致資料不完整"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 遷移過程中請勿關閉應用，取消遷移可能導致資料不完整"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Do not close the app during migration. Cancelling may leave data incomplete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• If source data is in iCloud and has files that are not downloaded, migration may take longer while downloads finish": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 如果源数据在 iCloud 中且有未下载的文件，需要等待下载完成，可能需要较长时间"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 如果源資料在 iCloud 中且有未下載的檔案，需要等待下載完成，可能需要較長時間"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 如果源資料在 iCloud 中且有未下載的檔案，需要等待下載完成，可能需要較長時間"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• If source data is in iCloud and has files that are not downloaded, migration may take longer while downloads finish"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Migrate Data: Move existing data to the new location": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 迁移数据：将现有数据迁移到新位置"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 遷移資料：將現有資料遷移到新位置"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 遷移資料：將現有資料遷移到新位置"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Migrate Data: Move existing data to the new location"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Use Directly: Use the new location and keep existing data unchanged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 直接使用：直接使用新位置，原有数据保持不变"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 直接使用：直接使用新位置，原有資料保持不變"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 直接使用：直接使用新位置，原有資料保持不變"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Use Directly: Use the new location and keep existing data unchanged"
          }
        }
      }
    },
